	(descr "Neutrik NE8FAV etherCON A-series receptacle, vertical PCB, rear mount. From Neutrik's PCB layout on ST-NE8FAV rev B (datasheets/connectors/NEUTRIK-NE8FAV-DRAWING.pdf), which is drawn from the solder side: MIRRORED here to KiCad's top (component) view, looking from the panel. Origin on the connector's axis. Contacts Ø0.8, G tab Ø1.2, four Ø1.7 plastic posts, one R1 slot 6.6 between centres.")
